WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.277 --> 00:00:03.093
Tumhe laga hoga... Ganpati

2
00:00:03.113 --> 00:00:04.963
ka itna bada julus...

3
00:00:06.249 --> 00:00:08.987
पंडाल.... Ye hazaron saal

4
00:00:09.007 --> 00:00:10.053
se chal raha hai?

5
00:00:11.075 --> 00:00:13.445
Sach ye hai... Atharah

6
00:00:13.465 --> 00:00:14.798
sau tiryaanve se pehle...

7
00:00:16.151 --> 00:00:17.843
Ganesh Chaturthi zyada tar

8
00:00:17.863 --> 00:00:18.810
ek ghar ke andar

9
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.153
ka tyohar tha. वो

10
00:00:21.173 --> 00:00:24.218
बड़ा स्ट्रीट पंडाल... वो

11
00:00:24.238 --> 00:00:27.917
जुलूस... Hazaron logo ka

12
00:00:27.937 --> 00:00:31.132
ikattha hona... Ye tha

13
00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:33.482
hi nahi. Phir ek

14
00:00:33.502 --> 00:00:34.500
aadmi ne isse badal

15
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:38.251
diya. बाल गंगाधर तिलक।

16
00:00:40.095 --> 00:00:41.500
British ne public sabha

17
00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.498
pe ban laga rakha

18
00:00:42.518 --> 00:00:44.470
tha. Toh Tilak ne

19
00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:45.774
Ganpati puja ko bahana

20
00:00:45.794 --> 00:00:48.338
banaya... Logo ko sadkon

21
00:00:48.358 --> 00:00:50.954
pe ikattha kiya... Castes

22
00:00:50.974 --> 00:00:53.474
ko jodkar... Azadi ki

23
00:00:53.494 --> 00:00:54.980
ladai ke liye taiyar

24
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.474
kiya. Toh is baar

25
00:00:57.494 --> 00:00:58.738
apne mohalle ka pandal

26
00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.445
dekho... Ye sirf tyohar

27
00:01:01.465 --> 00:01:03.928
nahi hai. Ye azadi

28
00:01:03.948 --> 00:01:05.560
ki ladai ka hathiyar

29
00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.931
tha... Jo aaj tak

30
00:01:07.951 --> 00:01:10.883
zinda hai. Aisi chhupi

31
00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:13.237
history ke liye... Channel

32
00:01:13.257 --> 00:01:13.831
follow kar lo.

